<header><p class="st-kicker">other · British Isles</p><h1 class="st-title">Southern Ireland</h1><p class="st-meta">1921 CE – 1922 CE · capital Dublin</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">The home-rule jurisdiction created by the Government of Ireland Act 1920 for twenty-six counties, which existed largely on paper until replaced by the Irish Free State.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/government-of-ireland-act-1920">Government of Ireland Act 1920</a> divided Ireland into two home-rule areas, <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/northern-ireland">Northern Ireland</a> and Southern Ireland, each with its own Parliament under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/palace-of-westminster">Westminster</a>. Southern Ireland came into existence in May 1921, when elections were held for its House of Commons.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sinn-fein">Sinn Fein</a> won 124 of the 128 seats unopposed but treated the election as one for the second <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dail-eireann">Dail</a> of the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/irish-republic">Irish Republic</a>, so the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/parliament-of-southern-ireland">Parliament of Southern Ireland</a> met only twice, in June 1921 and January 1922. Only the four members for <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/university-of-dublin">Dublin University</a> attended the first meeting.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>Its second meeting approved the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/anglo-irish-treaty">Anglo-Irish Treaty</a> and set up the Provisional Government under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/michael-collins">Michael Collins</a>. Southern Ireland was replaced by the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/irish-free-state">Irish Free State</a> on 6 December 1922.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><div class="st-emblem" role="img" aria-label="other, 1921 CE – 1922 CE"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M26 24 H74 V52 Q74 74 50 84 Q26 74 26 52 Z"/><path d="M50 24 V84 M26 46 H74"/></svg><p class="st-emblem-type">other</p><p class="st-emblem-region">British Isles</p><div class="st-span" aria-hidden="true"><span class="st-span-bar" style="left:97.93%;width:1.20%"></span></div><di